#: ../../source/gamedoc/music-sound.md:1
msgid "配乐和音效"
msgstr "Music and Sound Effects"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/music-sound.md:3
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;《灵数奇缘》游戏的配乐目前以EDM为主，希望能让创作出的游戏更加活泼。电子乐曲中不时会混入一点点国风。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;The soundtrack of Luv Sense Digital currently features mainly EDM, aiming to make the game more vibrant. The electronic tracks occasionally incorporate subtle elements of traditional Chinese music."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/music-sound.md:5
msgid "OST试听"
msgstr "OST Preview"
